	2942 [label="Pff ! I still think this is a worthy experiment. Perhaps we can wall off the devil in a sea of bookcases !",shape=box,color=blue];
		2942 -> 2943;
	2941 [label="I am going to dutifully ignore your sarcasm, because I think this is a worthy experiment. Perhaps we can wall off the devil in a sea of bookcases !",shape=box,color=blue];
		2941 -> 2943;
	1688 [label="I seek to aid us all in this... strange coexistence we have found ourselves, not to argue.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1688 -> 1686;
	1689 [label="No, not a game. But Entrati isn't to be trusted, and I don't know how else to convince you but to pretend to be on your side.",shape=box,color=red];
		1689 -> 1695;
	1690 [label="Oui ? Well, I am pleased to tell you, needn't do so any longer.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1690 -> 1696;
	1691 [label="Together, all as one, we are... a strange family. But a family, none the less.",shape=box,color=red];
		1691 -> 1697;
	1692 [label="We would be stronger together than we are apart.",shape=box,color=red];
		1692 -> 1698;
		1692 -> 1699;
	1693 [label="She's come to terms with his absence, and they've made peace with each other, but it was a hard-won thing.",shape=box,color=red];
		1693 -> 1700;
	1694 [label="She hasn't come to terms with his absence, and they're at each other's throats.",shape=box,color=red];
		1694 -> 1701;
	2943 [label="+20 Chemistry",color=orange];
		2943 -> 2944;
	1695 [label="Oui ? Well, I am pleased to tell you, you have failed.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1695 -> 1696;
	1696 [label="Update boolean MarieEntratiFan1",color=orange];
		1696 -> 1702;
	1697 [label="Add +1 to Family",color=orange];
		1697 -> 1698;
		1697 -> 1699;
	1698 [label="And in times when we're suffering, sometimes all we really have is each other. Either the ones we were given, or the ones we found.",shape=box,color=red];
		1698 -> 1703;
	1699 [label="I don't know if it would help, or hurt, in the long run. But this... purgatory, isn't right, either.",shape=box,color=red];
		1699 -> 1704;
	1700 [label="Knowing that he's still out there, running amok, and that he hasn't said a word to her, or even sent a letter...?",shape=box,color=red];
		1700 -> 1705;
	1701 [label="Knowing that he's still out there, running amok, and that he hasn't said a word to her, or even sent a letter...?",shape=box,color=red];
		1701 -> 1706;
	2944 [label="Much to do ! À la revoyure !",shape=box,color=blue];
		2944 -> 2929;
	1702 [label="Update boolean MarieEntratiFan2",color=orange];
		1702 -> 1707;
	1703 [label="Add +1 to Family",color=orange];
		1703 -> 1704;
	1704 [label="Oui, I agree. But I cannot be the one to bridge the gap between us. I don't know how to do it ! I am a stranger to them upstairs...",shape=box,color=blue];
		1704 -> 1708;
		1704 -> 1709;
	1705 [label="I can't imagine how painful that would be for her. For them.",shape=box,color=red];
		1705 -> 1710;
	1706 [label="It would destroy what little chance of reconciliation they might have.",shape=box,color=red];
		1706 -> 1711;
	2929 [label="Chat ends.",color=orange];
	1707 [label="Update boolean MarieNoDate",color=orange];
		1707 -> 1712;
	1708 [label="Loid knew the Entrati family. It should be him. Convincing him, however... is another matter.",shape=box,color=red];
		1708 -> 1713;
	1709 [label="Roathe, maybe? He's Orokin, he knew them all.",shape=box,color=red];
		1709 -> 1714;
	1710 [label="While I can see the logic behind the decision to protect them from the pain le Cardinal has caused by his necessary departure...",shape=box,color=blue];
		1710 -> 1715;
	1711 [label="Oui... I see the logic. I would work to mend their family, if you can, then, non ? It seems to be the only hope any of us have to get out of this place. ",shape=box,color=blue];
		1711 -> 1716;
	1712 [label="Chat ends.",color=orange];
	1713 [label="+5 Chemistry",color=orange];
		1713 -> 1717;
	1714 [label="Non, not the devil - anyone but the devil. But you are on to something. The natural choice is Monsieur Loid, non ?",shape=box,color=blue];
		1714 -> 1718;
	1715 [label="I do think it needlessly cruel, don't you ? They might think him dead. Or worse ! And we, living here, comme des rats d'égout ?",shape=box,color=blue];
		1715 -> 1719;
		1715 -> 1720;
		1715 -> 1721;
	1716 [label="Lest we spend the rest of our lives trapped living here, comme des rats d'égout. ",shape=box,color=blue];
		1716 -> 1722;
		1716 -> 1723;
	1717 [label="Oui, oui ! C'est ça ! But how do we convince him ? He has been stalwart in his position, non ?",shape=box,color=blue];
		1717 -> 1724;
		1717 -> 1725;
	1718 [label="But how do we convince him ? He has been stalwart in his position, non ?",shape=box,color=blue];
		1718 -> 1725;
		1718 -> 1724;
	1719 [label="I actually have a friend who loves rats. I think they're adorable.",shape=box,color=red];
		1719 -> 1726;
	1720 [label="It's not really my decision to make.",shape=box,color=red];
		1720 -> 1727;
	1721 [label="What would you suggest I do?",shape=box,color=red];
		1721 -> 1728;
	1722 [label="I actually have a friend who loves rats. I think they're adorable. ",shape=box,color=red];
		1722 -> 1729;
	1723 [label="I've been remiss. You're right. I'll get to work.",shape=box,color=red];
		1723 -> 1730;
	1724 [label="Do you think you or Lyon might convince him?",shape=box,color=red];
		1724 -> 1731;
	1725 [label="You're not going to like my answer, Marie...",shape=box,color=red];
		1725 -> 1732;
	1726 [label="And I would love to meet them some day, but that is hardly the point I am making, silly wolf.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1726 -> 1728;
	1727 [label="I know. It is Monsieur Loid's, and everyone else's decision, to make themselves known.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1727 -> 1728;
	1728 [label="I would suggest that it is a sense of guilt, not nobility, that keeps us down here.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1728 -> 1733;
	1729 [label="And I would love to meet them some day, but that is hardly the point I am making, silly wolf.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1729 -> 1728;
	1730 [label="Thank you. I do not know if you will succeed, but sometimes, we can only help but to try.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1730 -> 1728;
	1731 [label="He likes us well enough, he is kind and he is gentle. But we are étrangers to him, newcomers.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1731 -> 1734;
	1732 [label="Ah bon ?",shape=box,color=blue];
		1732 -> 1735;
	1733 [label="That we hide some great and terrible sin.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1733 -> 1736;
	1734 [label="I will think on it. You do the same ! A solution will be found, Sol has guided us this far !",shape=box,color=blue];
		1734 -> 1737;
	1735 [label="Loid might listen to Roathe. Him being Orokin - their shared history - might come in handy, here.",shape=box,color=red];
		1735 -> 1738;
	1736 [label="And it is that sin that must be forgiven, or proven to be false, perhaps ?",shape=box,color=blue];
		1736 -> 1739;
		1736 -> 1740;
	1737 [label="+15 Chemistry",color=orange];
		1737 -> 1741;
	1738 [label="Non ! He is a liar, he is a manipulator, he would only do this in exchange for some great fee !",shape=box,color=blue];
		1738 -> 1742;
	1739 [label="The situation upstairs is... fragile on the best of days. I don't want to upset them.",shape=box,color=red];
		1739 -> 1743;
	1740 [label="We just have to be careful. I'm afraid one half will see the other half as \"the other family.\"",shape=box,color=red];
		1740 -> 1744;
	1741 [label="We will find a way to convince Monsieur Loid to walk up those stairs... I know it.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1741 -> 1745;
	1742 [label="We will find another way to convince Monsieur Loid to walk up those stairs... I know it.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1742 -> 1746;
	1743 [label="You would be surprised how resilient the soul is. And those that surround me now are so very old, so very tempered by time.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1743 -> 1747;
	1744 [label="Add +1 to Family",color=orange];
		1744 -> 1748;
	1745 [label="I must go. Much to think on, much to do. À la revoyure.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1745 -> 1749;
	1746 [label="I must go. Much to think on, much to do. À la revoyure.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1746 -> 1750;
	1747 [label="You have surprised them many times. Let them surprise you this once.",shape=box,color=blue];
		1747 -> 1751;
	1748 [label="Oh Sol, I think you may have solved it !",shape=box,color=blue];
		1748 -> 1752;
